">Record yourself reading the sentences aloud. </span> <span class=\"bullet\">Compare yourself to the audio.</span> \n<br/> You have 2 attempts to submit your answers", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "type": "GIW"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "For years now, we have been told by environmentalists about the dangers of overfishing in the world's oceans. Species of fish are being wiped out. Now that so many fish are becoming extinct, the time has come to find an alternative. Is fish farming the answer? Environmentalists say no."}, {"time": "17500", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "Fish farming is a multi-million dollar industry that produces one third of the fish eaten in the world today. For a long time, people thought it was the solution to the problem of overfishing.<br/>\nUnfortunately, the young fish used in commercial fish farms are taken straight from the sea. They are also being fed ocean fish, such as anchovies and mackerel. It takes about five pounds of fish from the ocean to raise one pound of farmed fish. Fish farming is helping to decrease the numbers in certain species of fish in the sea."}, {"time": "48500", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "According to some environmental groups, the environment is being harmed by fish farming. Fish farms create animal waste and dangerous chemicals. These have been dumped directly into the coastal waters nearby and the biological life there is being endangered.<br/>\n\u201cFish farming is not the answer to feeding the world's population,\u201d said a well-known environmentalist. \u201cIt should be prohibited. We have to protect ocean life, and the best solution is to raise awareness and to encourage people to change their eating habits.\u201d"}], "video_src": "engenn9le02ob07re2vid01"}}], "_data": [], "id": 2, "type": "video"}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}